---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy policy" updated="September 25, 2026" description="How Shelf Made Home handles your data.">
  <p>This policy explains what information is collected when you visit shelfmadehome.com and how it is used.</p>
  <h2>Information collected</h2>
  <p>This site has no accounts, comment forms or newsletter sign-ups, so it does not ask you for personal information. If you email me, I receive your email address and message and use them only to reply.</p>
  <h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare. Like most hosting providers, Cloudflare processes technical data such as IP addresses to deliver and protect the site. This site may use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts visits without cookies and without tracking you across other websites.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
  <p>Some links go to Amazon. If you click one, Amazon may set cookies in your browser so that a purchase can be credited to this site. Those cookies are controlled by Amazon and covered by Amazon's own privacy notice. This site does not receive any personal information about you or what you buy.</p>
  <h2>Pinterest and fonts</h2>
  <p>The "Save to Pinterest" button is a plain link; Pinterest only receives data if you click it. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address when the page loads.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask what information I hold about you, or ask me to delete it, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page will be updated.</p>
</PageLayout>
